Password Generator (pip + OOP)
Install pyperclip (to copy password to clipboard).
Create a PasswordGenerator class with methods: generate(length, use_uppercase, use_digits, use_symbols) and copy_to_clipboard().
The user specifies criteria via command-line arguments or a simple prompt.
Save generated passwords to a JSON log (date, password, purpose).

Practice: Using pip packages, string manipulation, JSON logging.
